2. Created a mock organization branding data object with required fields
3. Wrapped the `Navigation` component with `OrgBrandingProvider` and passed the mock data
4. Kept the existing functionality with `isPlatformNavigation` prop

This should resolve the "useOrgBranding was used outside of OrgBrandingProvider" error by providing the required context provider and mock data.

